c.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $869 million: operating cash flow of $959 million less capital spending of $90.5 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","FFIV.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-01-26 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $23 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $44.5 million.","cites":["FFIV.pay.peoTotal.2025","FFIV.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $5.3 million in total and $7.1 million actually paid.","cites":["FFIV.pay.neoTotal.2025","FFIV.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $263.25 at the end of FY2025, and $284.85 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["FFIV.pay.tsr.2025","FFIV.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2.2 billion at the end of FY2026, against $2 billion a year earlier. That is 64.4% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["FFIV.rpo.2026","FFIV.rpo.2025","FFIV.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $2.2 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $2 billion a year earlier.","cites":["FFIV.deferred.2026","FFIV.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 6,645 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $514,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["FFIV.q.employees","FFIV.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $7 million, after $25.5 million in FY2025.","cites":["FFIV.restructuring.2026","FFIV.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $1.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $0 in short-term investments. No debt is tagged under the tags read here.","cites":["FFIV.cash.2026","FFIV.sti.2026"]}]},"fin":{"FFIV":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":98,"read":98,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Locoh-Donou Francois","President, CEO & Director, director"],["FOUNTAIN THOMAS DEAN","EVP Global Services & Strategy"],["MONTOYA MICHAEL F","Chief Technology Ops Officer"],["WHALEN CHAD MICHAEL","EVP, Worldwide Sales"],["ANAND KUNAL","Chief Technology Officer"],["Werner Edward Cooper","Chief Financial Officer"],["Maddison John Anthony","Chief Product Mkting Officer"],["OKEKE ANGELIQUE M","EVP, General Counsel"],["MEHTA NIKHIL RAMESH","Director"],["Buse Elizabeth","Director"],["Dreyer Michael L","Director"],["HIGGINSON ALAN","Director"],["SCHRAMM LYRA AMBER","Chief People Officer"]],"rows":[["S",0,3783,1186717.68,"2026-11-05","2026-11-05","0001526624-26-000023","2026-11-09",1],["S",1,9387,3095268.44,"2026-11-04","2026-11-04","0001728330-26-000022","2026-11-05",1],["S",2,1297,427600,"2026-11-04","2026-11-04","0001869466-26-000016","2026-11-05",1],["S",3,6950,2290423.28,"2026-11-03","2026-11-03","0001746640-26-000014","2026-11-05",1],["S",4,1989,644555.34,"2026-11-03","2026-11-03","0002016857-26-000014","2026-11-05",1],["S",5,599,194111.94,"2026-11-03","2